{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Solar Symphony 是一款結合 3D 視覺與音樂的宇宙探索 App，適合天文愛好者、教育工作者及想沉浸於太陽系之美的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-144.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>沉浸式太陽系探索</h2>\n<p>以真實 NASA 影像製作動畫行星與衛星，並可調整軌道角度、傾斜軸與行星自轉，觀察天體繞日運行的動態。內置超過 20 首器樂及人聲音樂，配合行星平均溫度等知識，讓探索更具沉浸感；簡報模式則可自動導覽太陽系。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-17-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-18-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-20-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2688x1242bb-21-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Solar Symphony</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/solar-symphony/id6736586548?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.263079+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T00:46:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:05.060830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:04.456310+00:00","content_hash":"f3952f685fc25fa222ea0d97361c31a0cf7f6c63fc8b136a6991017612dec182","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.263079+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}